# Generated by scripts/knowledge/compile-*.mjs on every predev and prebuild.
# Formatting these makes `npm run format:check` fail the moment anyone runs a
# build, because the generator writes its own layout back over Prettier's.
#
# Globs, not the six filenames this used to list. Adding changelog-index.md as
# a seventh output failed CI on a file nobody is supposed to hand-edit, which
# is the same shape as the .dockerignore that named a directory that did not
# exist: an ignore file enumerating what it protects goes stale the first time
# something is added. Everything generated into lib/ai is .md or .json and
# everything hand-written there is .ts, so the extension is the rule.
#
# The .json is also written minified on purpose: Prettier expands it from
# ~250 KB to ~450 KB of a file the server parses on boot and no human reads.
lib/ai/*.md
lib/ai/*.json
